exports[`buildOnboardingChecklist renders a partial checklist when only funding and reserve pass 1`] = `
"### Onboarding checklist

_Complete these steps in order. Boxes update automatically from live Horizon checks._

- [x] **Fund account** — Activate the account with XLM. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/FAQ.md#account-not-funded))
- [ ] **Add USDC trustline** — Configure the asset trustline. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/FAQ.md#trustline-missing))
- [x] **Verify XLM balance** — Meet the **1.5 XLM** reserve. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/FAQ.md#xlm-reserve-too-low))"
`;

